efits</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/health.html\">Health</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/taxes.html\">Taxes</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/environment.html\">Environment\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tand natural resources</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/defence.html\">National\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tsecurity and defence</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/culture.html\">Culture,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\thistory and sport</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/policing.html\">Policing,\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tjustice and emergencies</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/transport.html\">Transport\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tand infrastructure</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://international.gc.ca/world-monde/index.aspx?lang=eng\">Canada\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tand the world</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/finance.html\">Money and\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tfinances</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t\t<li role=\"presentation\"><a role=\"menuitem\"\r\n\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/services/science.html\">Science\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tand innovation</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</nav>\r\n\t<nav id=\"wb-bc\" property=\"breadcrumb\"\r\n\t\taria-labelledby=\"breadcrumbPosition\">\r\n\t\t<h2 id=\"breadcrumbPosition\">You are here:</h2>\r\n\t\t<div class=\"container\">\r\n\t\t\t<ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en.html\">Canada.ca</a></li>\r\n\t\t\t</ol>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</nav>\r\n</header>\r\n</div>\r\n    </div>    \r\n    <!-- Write closure template -->\r\n    <script>\r\n      /*<![CDATA[*/\r\n      var defTop = document.getElementById(\"def-top\");\r\n      defTop.outerHTML = wet.builder.top({\r\n          cdnEnv: \"Akamai\",\r\n          search: false,\r\n          lngLinks: [{\r\n              lang: \"fr\",\r\n              href: \"?lang=fre\",\r\n              text: \"Fran\\u0026ccedil;ais\"\n          }],\r\n          showPreContent: true,\r\n          breadcrumbs: [{\"title\":\"Health Canada\",\"titleEN\":null,\"titleFR\":null,\"href\":\"http:\\/\\/www.hc-sc.gc.ca\\/index-eng.php\",\"viewName\":null,\"acronym\":null},{\"title\":\"Drugs \\u0026amp; Health Products\",\"titleEN\":null,\"titleFR\":null,\"href\":\"http:\\/\\/www.hc-sc.gc.ca\\/dhp-mps\\/index-eng.php\",\"viewName\":null,\"acronym\":null},{\"title\":\"Natural Health Products\",\"titleEN\":null,\"titleFR\":null,\"href\":\"http:\\/\\/www.hc-sc.gc.ca\\/dhp-mps\\/prodnatur\\/index-eng.php\",\"viewName\":null,\"acronym\":null},{\"title\":\"Natural Health Products Ingredients Database\",\"titleEN\":null,\"titleFR\":null,\"href\":\"\\/nhpid-bdipsn\\/\",\"viewName\":null,\"acronym\":null}]\n      });\r\n      /*]]>*/\r\n    </script>\r\n    <main role=\"main\" property=\"mainContentOfPage\" class=\"container\">\r\n      <!-- the main content -->\r\n      <div>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"hidden\" id=\"_csrf\" value=\"8b8e0594-4ee3-46bd-acb5-e4c3f5faac16\"/>\n\t\t\t<div><span class=\"wb-sessto\" data-wb-sessto='{\"inactivity\": 7200000, \"reactionTime\": 300000, \"sessionalive\": 7200000, \"logouturl\": \"/nhpid-bdipsn\"}'></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t<h1 id=\"wb-cont\">Natural health products ingredients database</h1>\n\n\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-9\">  \n\t\t\t<p class=\"mrgn-bttm-0\">The Natural health products ingredients database (<abbr>NHPID</abbr>) provides an electronic tool which enables members of the public to access information on the following topics:</p>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"mrgn-tp-0\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"mrgn-bttm-0\">\n\t\t\t  \t\t<li>acceptable medicinal and non-medicinal ingredients used in Natural health products (<abbr>NHP</abbr>) </li>\n\t\t\t  \t\t<li>standard terminology used by the Natural health products online system (<abbr>NHP</abbr> Online System), known as \"Controlled vocabulary\", referring to acceptable quality test methods, dosage forms, non-medicinal ingredient purposes, and so on. </li>\n\t\t\t  \t\t<li>pre-cleared information such as single ingredient monographs and product monographs</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Members of the public can search these topics using the following search functions:</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"col-md-3\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"alert alert-info newlink\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"atReq?atid=whats.quoi\" class=\"at\">What's new in the <abbr title=\"Natural health products ingredients database\">NHPID</abbr></a>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"list-inline lst-spcd lastdt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Date data was last updated:</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>2026-04-23 22:37:02</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\t\t\n\t\t</div>\t\n\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t<!-- Ingredient Search Title -->\n\t<div class=\"panel panel-primary\">\n\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"panel-title\">Ingredient search</h2>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class =\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t<p>In the Ingredient search field, enter any part of an ingredient name or Chemical abstract service (<abbr>CAS</abbr>) number.  Select an ingredient role from the Role dropdown list, and click on the Search button to display the search results for the query.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<p>Please note that the homeopathic ingredient names and sources are mainly in English because it represents information coming from one French language pharmacopoeia and four English language pharmacopoeias.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<!-- Ingredient search controls fragment -->\n\t\t\t\n\t<form id=\"ingredientSearchForm\" action=\"/nhpid-bdipsn/searchIngred\" method=\"post\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"8b8e0594-4ee3-46bd-acb5-e4c3f5faac16\"/>\n\t\t<div class=\"form-horizontal\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"form-group\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-4 control-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"ingredientSearchText\"><span>Ingredient search:</span></label>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" id=\"ingredientSearchText\" type=\"text\" name=\"searchTxt\" maxlength=\"50\" size=\"25\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\tvalue=\"\">\n\t\t    \t</div>\n\t\t    \t<div id=\"ingredientSearchError\" style=\"font-weight: bold; color: crimson; display: none\">* The search field can not be empty</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"form-group\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-4 control-label \">\n\t\t\t  \t\t<label for=\"ingredientSearchRole\"><span>Role:</span></label> \n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<select id=\"ingredientSearchRole\" name=\"searchRole\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm col-sm-3\" value=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"-1\">All</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"HomeopathicRole\">Homeopathic</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"MedicinalRole\">Medicinal</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"NonMedicinalRole\">Non-medicinal</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"NonNHPRole\">Non-NHP</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"ComponentRole\">Component</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t\t\t \t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\t \n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"form-group\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-offset-4 col-sm-8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<button id=\"ingredientSearchButton\" class=\"btn btn-primary mrgn-tp-md\" type=\"submit\">Search</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t  \t</div>\n\t</form>\n\t\n<script>\n$(\"#ingredientSearchButton\").click(function(event) {\n\tif (!$(\"#ingredientSearchText\").val().trim()) {\n\t\tevent.preventDefault();\n\t\t$(\"#ingredientSearchError\").css('display','block');\n\t\t$(\"#ingredientSearchButton\").blur();\n\t}\n});\n\n$(\"#ingredientSearchText\").focus(function(event) {\n\t$(\"#ingredientSearchError\").css('display','none');\n});\n</script>\t\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<!-- Vocabulary Search Title -->\n\t<div class=\"panel panel-primary center-block\">\n\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"panel-title\">Controlled vocabulary search</h2>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class =\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t<p>Controlled vocabulary provides a standard for the electronic transmission of core sets of natural health product information.  In the Controlled vocabulary search field, enter any part of a controlled vocabulary term.  Select a category from the Category dropdown list, and click on the Search button to display the search results for the query.</p>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<p>The search engines treat the Controlled vocabulary search field as a sequence of characters to search for.  They accept letters in either uppercase or lowercase.  The search engines ignore operators such as AND, NOT, and OR.</p>\n\t\t\t<p>If the search is unsuccessful, try synonyms, alternate spellings or other combinations of keywords.</p>\n\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t<span>For additional search tips, please consult the </span>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/pubs/natur/guide_app_donnees-eng.php\">Natural health products ingredients database web application guide</a>.\n\t\t\t\t<span>For more information on the terminology please consult the </span>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://www.hc-sc.gc.ca/dhp-mps/pubs/natur/osstg-gtnps-eng.php\">Natural health products online system standard terminology guide</a>.\n\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t<!-- Vocabulary Search controls fragment -->\n\t\t\t\n\t<form id=\"vocabularySearchForm\" action=\"/nhpid-bdipsn/searchVocab\" method=\"post\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_csrf\" value=\"8b8e0594-4ee3-46bd-acb5-e4c3f5faac16\"/>\n\t\t<div class=\"form-horizontal\">\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"form-group\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-4 control-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<label for=\"vocabularySearchText\"><span>Controlled vocabulary search:</span></label>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-8\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<input class=\"form-control form-control-sm\" id=\"vocabularySearchText\" type=\"text\" name=\"searchTxt\" maxlength=\"50\" size=\"35\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\tvalue=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"form-group\">\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-4 control-label\">\n\t\t\t  \t\t<label for=\"vocabularyCategory\"><span>Category:</span></label>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<select id=\"vocabularyCategory\" name=\"searchCategory\" class=\"form-control form-control-sm col-sm-4\" value=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"chemcls\">Chemical Classes</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"chemscls\">Chemical Subclasses</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"cp\">Countries</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"dfp\">Dosage Forms</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"dfgp\">Dosage Form Groups</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"geo\">Geographical Areas</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"icat\">Ingredient Categories</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"classif\">Natural Health Product Classifications</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"pf\">Non-Medicinal Ingredient Purposes</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"prep\">Organism Part Preparation Types</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"opt\">Organism Part Types</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"typorg\">Organism Types</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"rva\">Routes of Administration</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"solv\">Solvents</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"tm\">Test Methods</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<option value=\"unts\">Units of Measurement</option>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</select>\n\t \t\t\t</div>\t\n\t \t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"form-group\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-offset-4 col-sm-8\">\t\n\t\t  \t\t\t<button class=\"btn btn-primary mrgn-tp-md\" type=\"submit\" onclick=\"this.disabled=true;this.form.submit()\">Search</button>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t</form>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t<!-- Monograph List -->\n\t<div class=\"panel panel-primary center-block\">\n\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"panel-title\">Pre-Cleared information</h2>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class =\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t<p>Pre-Cleared information (<abbr>PCI</abbr>) is any form of information supporting the safety, efficacy or quality of a medicinal ingredient or natural health product that <abbr title=\"Natural and Non-prescription Health Products Directorate\">NNHPD</abbr> has reviewed and determined to be acceptable.  </p>\n\t\t\t<p><abbr title=\"Pre-Cleared information\">PCI</abbr> can be used to speed up the evaluation of the <abbr title=\"Natural Health Products\">NHP</abbr>, and serves as a reliable source of product information for consumers.</p>    \n\t\t\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/nhpid-bdipsn/monosReq?monotype=single\">Single ingredient monographs</a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t<li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/nhpid-bdipsn/monosReq?monotype=product\">Product monographs </a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<h2>To propose changes to the <abbr title=\"Natural Health Products Ingredients Database\">NHPID</abbr></h2>\n\t<p>For additions or modifications to the <abbr title=\"Natural Health Products Ingredients Database\">NHPID</abbr>, please fill in a Natural Health Products Ingredients Database Request Form.</p>\n\t<p>Link: <a href=\"https://forms-formulaires.alpha.canada.ca/en/id/cmbi73nxi005byo01j1og4qd2\">Natural Health Products Ingredients Database Request Form</a></p>\n\n<script>\n$(\".at\").on(\"click\", function(e) {\n\tvar url = $(this).attr(\"href\");\n\tvar idx = url.indexOf(\".do\");\n\tif (idx > 0) {\n\t\turl = url.substring(0, idx) + url.substring(idx+3);\n\t}\n\t$(this).attr(\"href\", url);\n});\n</script>\n\n</div>\n\t\t</div>\r\n      <!-- end main content -->\r\n      <div id=\"def-preFooter\">\r\n        <!-- Write closure fall-back static file -->\r\n        <div><div class=\"pagedetails\">\r\n\t<div class=\"row\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"col-sm-6 col-md-5 col-lg-4\">\r\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/report-problem.html\"\r\n\t\t\t\tclass=\"btn btn-default btn-center\">Report a problem on this page</a>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t<dl id=\"wb-dtmd\">\r\n\t\t<dt>Date modified:&#32;</dt>\r\n\t\t<dd>\r\n\t\t\t<time property=\"dateModified\">2019-03-01<